Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.70,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(174,5)}The Life Do-Over Device
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.70,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(126,254)}Brought to you by: Ko-FI.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to play too, kick me the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna play too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, Suneo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.79,0:01:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I will kick it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Nobita? You're so clumsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly pass the ball around!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, can you kick the ball this way, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't I seen you somewhere before?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.73,0:01:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But mister, I think this is my first time seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.. Maybe I mistook you for someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing there, Nobita?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I am coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, please give me the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Do you know that mister over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:02:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't know him. But he asked me has he seen me before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.53,0:02:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of homework...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, Nobita why don't you improve your football skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Practicing for Soccer match, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.32,0:02:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for today and are about to head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, where are you going to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cram School.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.85,0:02:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cram School?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a study girl, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really. Why don't you guys join my cram school as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a tutor at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't really need cram schools, unlike Nobita, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Suneo has tough times once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We have guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nice kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, come on, say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can write alphabets, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So smart, show me then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You have brought your stationery kit, huh? What a thoughtful boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.57,0:03:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I wrote my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You can write Kanji? How great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Though he can only write his name for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But any preschooler can write, it ain't such a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But Toshio-{\i1}chan{\i0} just turned 5 year old, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,5 years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can write my name too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you are 5th grader.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Toshio is a wonder child!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 8 cookies on the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,4 people can share 2 pieces each among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you can calculate as well. What a smart little boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Know 13 + 26? = 39
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,5x5=25, 15x2=30
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then 1/6th of x is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, you're exaggerating that little boy's achievements...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What he can, I can too..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure. But you {\i1}are{\i0} a 5th grader...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But a 5-year old boy being able to do that. He's too smart for his age.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,5-years old and 5th grader, seriously, who cares? We're both 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.45,0:05:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, being mocked by Giant and Suneo outdoors...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And being compared to a 5 year boy at home...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, wish I could become 5 years old again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but with my intellect intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Yes, you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can become a 5-year old boy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Life Do-Over Device!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has moments in their life that they wish they could do over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This device lets you go back and relive those moments differently..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.76,0:05:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,With my present physical strength and intellect intact?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course! So that you won't make the same mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! I'll re-do my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna live the life of my dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}'s present age: 11 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,To what age do you wanna go back to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,5-years old, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Would using this machine hurt me physically?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are worried, then maybe don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wanna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been here before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.43,0:07:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I remember, this was the lumberyard...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.57,0:07:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the neighborhood where I used to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've shrunk and I don't need glasses neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, I am 5-year old again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to play here all the time! This really takes me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are ya doin' up there!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide and seek's no fun if you don't look for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.14,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant and Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.44,0:08:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't Call me cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So Giant was violent even at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Takeshi-{\i1}san{\i0}, stop, you mustn't bully on a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} was very kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wimpy Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.44,0:08:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wimpy Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowpoke Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So they made fun of me even at this early!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play some fun game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.99,0:09:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play the school game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.89,0:09:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I will be the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I should be the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll, I can write kanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can write too, it's no big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, let's all write Kanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.07,0:09:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's so fun in this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You wrote Suneo in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.55,0:09:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine is correct
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} is so smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine is done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's written here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that even a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, write down your name, let us see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is ..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.35,0:10:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}chan{\i0}, you can write kanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course, It is so simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, you made it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's real Kanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.83,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll know who's right after we show it to an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring here that mister over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like for you to read something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi Nobita, is it a name of someone you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You wrote it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So that was a real Kanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, can you write something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring, Summer, Fall and Winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mountains, streams, woods..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, have you did any special classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What a Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't accept that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree with Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0} was again made to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Nobita. \NYou are boy, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Auntie, you have got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He made them cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just pushed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They started crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, stop being violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.89,0:12:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the first time I hear such complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The boys play out together and sometimes violence breaks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.77,0:12:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my business card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The researcher of Education of gifted children
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:13:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come today for Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.12,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm astonished that he's just a 5-year old and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He can already read and write kanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.69,0:13:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But he has just started studying Hiragana.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he learned to write by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0} wrote it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How elegant it looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother-in-law, have you taught him writing secretly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Never did!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He can write a lot of words
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,1 should write more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.19,0:13:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He can write so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.50,0:13:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do some other test!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, please answer the following question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 3 Apples, and 3 Bananas, so how many fruits are there in total?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,6!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask a harder question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, 35+13=?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,48!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm not dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can recite the multiplicaation table
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,2 x 1 = 2
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.83,0:14:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,2x2=4
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,2x3=6
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.60,0:14:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,2x4=8, 2x5=10, 2x6=12
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How great it feels to already know everything beforehand!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I am quite astonished myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I tested him in various fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that he's just 5 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean your child is a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His intellect is on the same level with a primary schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.39,0:14:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,5 years old, with the same intellect as a primary schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm a primary schooler in the body of 5 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:15:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's at least on the level of 2nd grade primary schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually am a 5th grader.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, he passed the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart, Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank god,!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He is sure to get into Tokyo University.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have to go to cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.76,0:15:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he'll be a professor or a minster, any of them could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}! Do you wanna go pee?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so considerate of you, Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't wait to see him growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How happy our lives are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.47,0:16:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it's me, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's you, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy your time here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure did...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's about time we leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna. Everyone here is happy about me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I will grow up like this only.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think that's a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,why not? I'm a genius, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks I'll be a professor or even a minister...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.16,0:16:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll get worse eventually...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.30,0:16:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, you must put more effort...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,rather than simply relying on Life Do-Over Machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.55,0:16:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Time TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:17:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you what happens in this timeline!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,First grade, primary school!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.03,0:17:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Gouda-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's handing down the exam results.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So smart, full marks again..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I am home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna see my marks card?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,100 again? It's pretty obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,1'm going out to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the study?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Too simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I should ask the teacher to skip the next 3 grades and promote him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita's here to rescue our team!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita's here, the victory's gonna be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Got!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Nobita-{\i1}chan{\i0}. You're great at studies, and sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.93,0:18:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy that I choose to redo my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, see what it is like in the 5 grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you're trying to hide from me, you must have got 0 again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.51,0:18:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and study harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.51,0:18:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, I will study.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.81,0:18:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.48,0:18:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have the intellect of a 2nd grader.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,IQ has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Rewind to a little earlier time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what happened today...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:19:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna play too...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Same as today's morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I will kick it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't I seen you somewhere before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it just the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, watch what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.. maybe I mistook you for someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.85,0:19:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing there, Nobita?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick it to you now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita! You are Nobi Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.85,0:19:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I am Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.15,0:19:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The educator from the genius academy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,who found you when you were 5 years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.69,0:19:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're that educator mister from back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm shocked to see you like this, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're totally different than the last time I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.09,0:19:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no shine in your eyes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder I didn't recognized you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the genius boy, I once knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.98,0:20:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now; say do you still want to see more or grow up in this timeline?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't wanna see any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go back, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.87,0:20:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how did you liked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you understand now that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to put in effort in order to succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.37,0:20:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go study!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. That's the way, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm gonna study harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll invent a device that makes you smart...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...without ever having to study!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He still doesn't get it...
